B.KV=new A.ws("Bob was given a little toy house made of Lego. He wanted to see how it was put together, so he carefully took it apart. Bob noticed the Lego pieces were not all the same: some were chunky bricks, some were long flat tiles and some were sloped like little roofs. Now they are all spread out on the floor in front of him. He has a question and needs your help.","assets/Resources/Legos/Bob's Lego Story.png",null)
